            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Only if you need to clean where there is no outlet or no pressurized water supply, such as a boat, a remote fence or a campsite. Many cordless models can draw from a bucket. They cost more, especially once batteries are included, and deliver less sustained power than corded electric machines, so most homeowners are better served by a corded unit."
          }
        }
